<table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Feb 6, 2004 :: Hrm... I slack, therefore I am</div><P>Another weekday Ring War! Grats Jenrenee on your Ring of Dain Frostreaver! Other winners were Lairiel on the Crown of Narandi, Airosexiest on the Choker of the Wretched, Kelnya the Ghetto Rogue on the Faceguard of Bentos the Hero! The lance, earring and range thingie all went to greed rolls and um.. people won them. </P>
<P>Frogger led some folks to kill PoS minis again, getting a few more keyed up, and we had a couple groups head up again and finish off a couple more named. </P>
<P>Kasserole got the wifebeater from Sleepers, and Grellk got a lance (go go peircing skill!!), as well as Zav and Balut getting their much needed daggers. /nods</P>
<P>Some of the leveling grats I missed are: <BR>Grats Dorina on 65 and Prophet!<BR>Grats Sindall on 65 and Archon!<BR>Grellk&nbsp;on 63!<BR>Perragon on 60 and Crusader!<BR>Ewlala on 56!<BR>Reivan(muffins) on 55 and evoker!<BR>Demiana on 38! <BR><BR>I know I missed people, cause the motd kept poofing. I blame Arglar. </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Feb 7, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Feb 2, 2004 :: Grummus battle... artist rendering</div><P>Since none of ya bums thought ta take a picture of the fight and since I was a wee bit busy during it I thought ta make Meeka happy I would include my own rendition of what they battle was like for those that may have missed it.&nbsp;&nbsp; It is like you can almost still hear the clash of steel and the dying scream of Vorne.</P>
<P><IMG alt="Grummus battle" hspace=0 src="http://home.mchsi.com/~tonkatank/Grummus.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Arglar</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Feb 1, 2004 :: Vorne Dead!</div><P>No ring war trigger up for Jenrenee, so we'll have to wage war on the giants at a later date! Colwn and Vorne both got head to make some <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=4363">gloves</A> and Arglar's favorite <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=4362">belt</A>. Kithik got a <A href="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/loot.asp?itemid=223">nice new necklace</A>, Mahrsan got a <A href="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/loot.asp?itemid=172">nifty toy</A> so he can whine less when there's no shaman near him, Wonderous got a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6099">pretty little handbag</A>, Bery got a <A href="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/loot.asp?itemid=425">new mask</A>, Bufowski saved a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=4553">mace</A> from rot, Druentia saved a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6010">shield</A> from rot and both Bery and Zavitar saved a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=4625">crown</A> from rotting! </P>
<P>Decided to go kill the fat man and his lackeys. Great job everyone! Healers kept everyone healthy, Arglar held Grummus' attention rock solid, and Colwn offtanked the mob that was in his room.&nbsp; Mahrsan and Vorne did their great job pulling, and even got to scare Wonderous, which is so much fun. Nobody that I know of took pictures, so have to post someone elses. Oh, loot... Grats Mytee Mouse on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16497">Diseased Ratskin Mask</A> and Corbane on the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16655">Ring of the Pox-bearer</A>. Aramin's loot went to greed rolls... that <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16381">disease thingy staff</A> and some <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/bracerofrottingbile.JPG">resist chain class thing</A> that I forget. It looked like a white coldain shawl thingy. /nods</P>
<P><IMG alt=Fatty! hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/grummus.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Grats Kelnya and Sparkley&nbsp;on 63!<BR>Grats Dantiel on 61!<BR>Grats Grellk on 58!<BR>Grats Thrakish on 54!<BR></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Feb 1, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jan 31, 2004 :: Frogs Terrorize Giants!</div><P>Some frogs, and others, headed into Storms one night tearing beards, sashes and bones to finish up some keys into BoT. I think Bukowski was actually filming for his next adult frog film.. I mean.. come on.. he took their belts and then their 'bones?' What else could that mean. Especially on the tail of this... </P>
<P><IMG alt="Bukowski's home movies" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/frogpron0.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Killed more first broods, got more keys, and headed into Sleepers again. Grats Wonderous on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=25145">Bladesoul's Spiritual Diadem</A>! Emanci got a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16076">skull on a stick</A>, Greylok got a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16092">pretty poker</A>, Reide got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16298">wifebeater</A> (not to be used on Greylok.. unless she asks of course), Anarandil saved an <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16074">axe</A> from rotting and Colwn compensated for something with a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16075">lance</A>. </P>
<P>Leveling grats...<BR>Grats Bearbane on 65 and Overlord!<BR>Grats Darkyn on 63!<BR>Grats Valoura and Ahyth on 57!<BR>Grats Lovem on 55 and .. erm.. troubadour I think!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Jan 31, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jan 27, 2004 :: Grats Zelcon on your fancy shmancy shawl!!</div><P>Thanks all for coming for a quick run over to do the shawl war for Zelcon after killing the fatty fast! This time we just had Mahrsan walk the General where we wanted him, with the General doing his best to kill our fearless monk in the process! </P>
<P>In the end, it was one very happy kitty with a fancy new shawl! Grats Zelcon!! </P>
<P>Think I've missed these levels...</P>
<P>Grats Valkyra on 65 and Prophet!<BR>Grats Cimmy and Dorina on 64!<BR>Grats Tankorr on 63!<BR>Grats Ladibugg on 61!<BR>Grats Grellik on 55 (prob higher by now)<BR>Grats Reivan on 54!<BR>Grats BUfo and Thiia on 46!</P>
<P>And I leave you with a scary image....<BR><IMG alt=Aeeieeeeaaaa!!! hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/shatta.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Jan 28, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jan 24, 2004 :: Terris Thule takes a nap!</div><P>Had to finish with our task of saving Balut from Nightmares, so we headed into her lair and knocked her down. Grats Kleria and Ccra on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/KnuckleboneBeadedVeil.gif">Knucklebone Beaded Veils</A>! </P>
<P><IMG alt="Not so pretty dead!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/terris.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jan 23, 2004 :: Falling behind again!</div><P>Some more folks have leveled, and I don't have a list in front of me! I'm sure another officer will edit those in *hint hint*</P>
<P>Killed the pretty white dragon in his tower again. Grats Raihndance on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/yelinaks_talisman.JPG">his talisman</A>, Vorne on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/yelinakshead.jpg">his head</A>, Zavitar saved <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/Celestial_Essence_Robe.jpg">a robe</A> from rotting, Punkgurl saved <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/craslith.jpg">a sword</A> from the same fate and Ceyria saved <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/sacrifice.jpg">a mace</A> as well. Kasserole won <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/maskofthedragonslayer.jpg">the mask</A> on greed rolls! </P>
<P>Headed into Sleepers and got the elusive <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Ancient_Prismatic_Bow.jpg">Prismatic Bow</A> to drop. Wait, that's not accurate... got THREE of the damn things to drop. Grats Beryllin, Antroe and Papajay! Cerdiwan got his <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Ancient_Prismatic_Axe.jpg">Prismatic Axe</A>, Anarandil got his much desired <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/ancientprismaticclaymore.jpg">Claymore</A> and Divan got a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Ancient_Prismatic_Stiletto.jpg">Stiletto</A>! Got more quest stuff and Wonderous got the last peice needed to finish the quest on our next trip in! Jenrenee also got a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/eyeofthederanged.gif">nifty ranged item</A> for fun too! </P>
<P>&nbsp;</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jan 20, 2004 :: Dead Xanny for fun!</div><P>Thanks to Wonderous for planning&nbsp;Xanny and Mahrsan for taking over running it when Wonderbuns had carpool issues and was late! Nice work all! Course, I realized as we were doing it that I don't think more than 1 of us needed the flag. /chuckles</P>
<P>Grats Kasserole on the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/CordHiltedSpikeDriver.gif">Cord Hilted Spike Driver</A> and Spark on the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/PulsingPhaseEmitter.gif">Phase Pulse Emitter thingy of goodness</A>!! Not bad for an hour of work :)</P>
<P>Grats Iionz on 61!<BR>Grats Thrakish on 51 and Primalist!<BR>Grats Bufo on 42!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><span class="page-scroll">Pages: <a href='news.asp?page=3'>&laquo;</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=1'>1</a> <a href='news.asp?page=2'>2</a> <a href='news.asp?page=3'>3</a> 4 <a href='news.asp?page=5'>5</a> <a href='news.asp?page=6'>6</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=14'>14</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=5'>&raquo;</a></span></td>
